<h4 dir="auto" class="">Takeaway</h4>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Information-theoretic view: EAIMR is a mind detector for improbably coherent orderâ€”high surprisal under a null, discounted for shortcuts, and boosted by functional integration.</p>
