Humans with aphantasia or anendophasia: Same dynamic â€” if you canâ€™t generate narrative or imagery internally, youâ€™re treated as if youâ€™re â€œmissing something,â€ even when you may be processing the world through equally valid (or even sharper) functional reasoning.
