Do you want me to sketch how this loophole logic could be formalized â€” e.g. as a modified â€œeffective assembly indexâ€ that discounts for reuse, parallelism, and degeneracy â€” so it can slot into your larger theoretical system? Thatâ€™s a great pair of examples â€” they show exactly how an assembly-index lens could reveal minds we usually dismiss.
